## Objective

Make R36 mechanically decidable for an implementation's genuine default path.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Start with no paid account, subscription, API credential or metered provider.
- [ ] Permit only the declared model acquisition, then block all other external traffic.
- [ ] Build and query the committed fixture successfully through effective local providers.
- [ ] Pin and check runtime/model acquisition and licence metadata when artifacts change.
- [ ] Add fail-controls for a required API credential and a metered provider.
